  "solution": {
    "text": "Solving <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math> and <math><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo></math> we get the intersection points&nbsp;<math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mi>Q</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />The equations of the tangents at these points are <math><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math> and <math><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math>&nbsp;The slopes of the tangents at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>Q</mi></math> are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math> respectively<br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math>&nbsp;The slopes of the normals at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>Q</mi></math> are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math> respectively<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>34</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>34</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>34</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math>"
  }
